## **Learnings**
✅ **Using `set()` to eliminate duplicates efficiently**.  
✅ **Checking conditions (`hundreds ≠ 0`, ones must be even) early prevents unnecessary processing**.  
✅ **Sorting ensures correct ordering of results**.

